<div class="wp-block-wdl-lw-content-8 lw-content-8"><ul class="lw-content-8__inner clm_3" style="max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto"><li class="lw-content-8__li" style="border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:2px;border-style:solid;padding-top:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px;border-radius:8px"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-contact/" class="link"><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid"><span class="sub" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;display:inline-block;color:var(--color-main);background-color:#ffffff">type 01</span><span class="main left" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:700">知事許可</span></h3><p class="lw-content-8__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">営業所が1つの都道府県だけにある場合です。ほとんどの事業者はこちらに当たります。</p><div class="link_btn" style="margin-top:16px;padding:0 1em;height:56px;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--color-main);color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;border-radius:2px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0px;border-style:none">詳細はこちら</div></a></li><li class="lw-content-8__li" style="border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:2px;border-style:solid;padding-top:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px;border-radius:8px"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-contact/" class="link"><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid"><span class="sub" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;display:inline-block;color:var(--color-main);background-color:#ffffff">type 02</span><span class="main left" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:700">大臣許可</span></h3><p class="lw-content-8__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">営業所が2つ以上の都道府県にある場合です。他県に支店を出したときに切り替えが必要になります。</p><div class="link_btn" style="margin-top:16px;padding:0 1em;height:56px;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--color-main);color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;border-radius:2px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0px;border-style:none">詳細はこちら</div></a></li><li class="lw-content-8__li" style="border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:2px;border-style:solid;padding-top:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px;border-radius:8px"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-contact/" class="link"><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid"><span class="sub" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;display:inline-block;color:var(--color-main);background-color:#ffffff">type 03</span><span class="main left" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:700">一般建設業</span></h3><p class="lw-content-8__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">下請に出す金額が一定の額より小さい場合です。通常はこちらになります。</p><div class="link_btn" style="margin-top:16px;padding:0 1em;height:56px;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--color-main);color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;border-radius:2px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0px;border-style:none">詳細はこちら</div></a></li><li class="lw-content-8__li" style="border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:2px;border-style:solid;padding-top:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px;border-radius:8px"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-contact/" class="link"><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid"><span class="sub" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;display:inline-block;color:var(--color-main);background-color:#ffffff">type 04</span><span class="main left" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:700">特定建設業</span></h3><p class="lw-content-8__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">元請として下請に出す金額が大きい場合です。金額の基準は法令で決まっています。</p><div class="link_btn" style="margin-top:16px;padding:0 1em;height:56px;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--color-main);color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;border-radius:2px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0px;border-style:none">詳細はこちら</div></a></li></ul></div>
